ont a regal property overseeing the Raj Bhavan. The exclusive collection of limited 3 and 4-bedroom residential apartments will fulfil your dreams and aspirations of a place you can call your own.\nRead More\n\nStarting from\n\n₹ 12.73 Cr\n\n₹ 1,05,450 /Sq. Ft\n\n+ Charges\n\nKalpataru Kshitij\nKalpataru Kshitij\nKalpataru Kshitij\nKalpataru Developer Logo\n\n## Kalpataru Kshitij in Malabar Hill, Mumbai [...] Starting from\n\n₹ 5.20 Cr\n\n₹ 96,550 /Sq. Ft\n\n+ Charges\n\nMittal Dariya Mahal\nMittal Builders Developer Logo\n\n## Mittal Dariya Mahal in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMittal Dariya Mahal is a well designed, luxury apartment project located in Mumbai South, Mumbai. The project offers 296 units across 3BHK-6BHK in sizes ranging from 1225 sqft to 5000 sqft.\nRead More\n\nPrice On Request\n\n₹ 52,952 /Sq. Ft\n\nPrice On Request\n\n₹ 52,952 /Sq. Ft\n\nMittal Sagar Kunj\nMittal Builders Developer Logo\n\n## Mittal Sagar Kunj in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMittal Sagar Kunj is an upcoming residential project in Mumbai South, Mumbai. The project offers 2BHK-3BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 900 sqft to 2000 sqft.\nRead More\n\nPrice On Request\n\nPrice On Request\n\nAvighna Satlaj Terrace\nAvighna India Ltd Developer Logo","score":0.86713725,"raw_content":null,"id":"9e80cd-02"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-waterview-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343430393335","title":"Lodha Lodha Waterview in Malabar Hill, Mumbai | MagicBricks","content":"Birla Anayu are key nearby under-construction projects. HM Central Park, Satellite Sesen, Mesacon The South Bay, Arkade Rise, Orbit Shivam are among the nearby societies that are ready for possession. [...] The project consists of 1 towers. The official launch date of the project was April 2024.The possession schedule of Lodha Waterview is June 2028. Strategically located, the complete address of this project is Plot No 310 And 311, Cumballa Hill, Malabar Hill, South Mumbai, Mumbai. Its pincode is 400006. The property comes with facilities. Among the key amenities are Power Back Up, Security, Park and more. It also offers amenities like Sewage treatment plant, Aesthetically designed landscape garden, Waste water recycling, Fire Fighting Equipment, among others. As of today, 2 properties are listed for sale by owners and dealers, providing multiple options to explore. Kalpataru Prive, Runwal Malabar, Dhuleva Seven, Aurum Girnar, Birla Anayu are key nearby under-construction projects. HM [...] Project Details\n\nAbout Lodha Waterview\n\nLodha Waterview Status Under Construction\nLodha Waterview Launch Date 01 April 2024\nLodha Waterview Possession Date 01 June 2028\nTowers in Lodha Waterview 1\n Lodha Waterview is one of the well-known project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, which offers property options starting from $priceRange. The project is designed by Lodha Developers Limited, a well-known and trusted developer in India. As of now, the project is in the Under Construction position. It is spread over an area of 1 Acre. There are in total 11 units in this project.","score":0.85216236,"raw_content":null,"id":"98de86-03"},{"url":"https://housing.com/in/buy/projects/page/288760-lodha-malabar-wing-a-and-b-by-lodha-group-in-malabar-hill","title":"Lodha Malabar Wing A And B in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price, Reviews & Floor Plan","content":"Lodha Group crossed a direct employee strength of 3,000 in 2013. A committed management team, equipped with extensive technical expertise and domain knowledge, works towards providing timely and high-quality solutions for its clients. The developer exhibits a passion for going the last mile in order to seek excellence and exceed customers’ expectations. It complied with its corporate values of integrity and ethics when dealing with all the stakeholders.\n\nLodha Group has launched over 164 residential projects and is working on 85 ongoing projects. The builder holds the merit of delivering over 35 million sqft of real estate space accounting for about 30 projects in and around Mumbai (from Napean Sea Road to Dombivali). [...] With a vision of 'Building a Better Life', Lodha Group promotes ‘leadership through innovation’ and has spearheaded several landmark developments such as World One - the world's tallest residential tower, and the Palava City - the first Greenfield Smart City in the country. The group was honoured with the Green Good Design Award 2012 for World One. It won 5 STAR for Best Interior Design for project Lodha Fiorenza. [...] The Palava city by Lodha Group is an over 4,000-acre integrated city which is set to be one of the world's top 50 most liveable cities. Residential units by the group include 2 and 3BHK apartments of sizes 500 sqft to luxury roomy 4BHK villas of size 5,000 sqft.\n\nLodha Aqua\nLodha Kandivali Project Tower 3\nLodha Kandivali Project Tower 4\nLodha Trump Tower\nLodha Aurum\nLodha Grandeur\nLodha Codename Supernova\nLodha Codename Mumbai City Centre\nLodha World Crest\nLodha The Park Town Houses\n\n## Curated Solutions\n\n## FAQs about Lodha Malabar Wing A And B\n\n### What is the pin code of Lodha Malabar Wing A And B?\n\n### Are there good hospitals in the vicinity of Lodha Malabar Wing A And B?\n\n### What security features are available at Lodha Malabar Wing A And B?\n\n### Who is the builder of the project?","score":0.8025714,"raw_content":null,"id":"3cb69d-04"},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KDsBCAXdxd8","title":"Lodha Malabar Hills | South Mumbai | Sea View | Project Overview |  ( Lodha Preferred Partner )","content":"हेलो एंड वेलकम टू प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड। मैं हूं रोशनी और मैं लेकर आई हूं आपके लिए एक और एक्साइटिंग प्रोजेक्ट। इस प्रोजेक्ट का नाम है लोधा मालाबार जो एक प्रीमियम अल्ट्रा लग्जरियस सीन रेजिडेंशियल टावर है जो साउथ मुंबई के सबसे प्रेस्टीजियस एरिया वालकेश्वर मालाबार हिल में लोकेटेड है। इन दिस वीडियो वी आर गोइंग टू डिस्कस प्रोजेक्ट ओवरव्यू लोकेशन एडवांटेजेस, इम्युनिटीज़, प्राइिंग, बुकिंग ऑफर्स एंड मच मोर। सिचुएटेड बसाइड द आइकॉनिक राजभवन सराउंडेड बाय हेरिटेज लैंडमार्क्स। जैसे कि हैंगिंग गार्डन्स और मालाबार हिल क्लब। लोधा मालाबार एक सिंबल है रिफाइंड लिविंग का लोकेटेड इन वन ऑफ द वर्ल्ड्स मोस्ट कोवेटेड नेबरहुड्स। हर अपार्टमेंट में आपको मिलेगा अनइंटरप्टेड सीवू, एलगेंट इंटीरियर्स और एक एक्सेप्शनल एरिया ऑफ़ इम्युनिटीज इंक्लूडिंग स्टनिंग इंफिनिटी पूल जो ओशन को भी ओवरलुक करता है। यह स्पेशली उन लोगों के लिए [...] पूल जो ओशन को भी ओवरलुक करता है। यह स्पेशली उन लोगों के लिए डिजाइन किया गया है जो कंफर्ट और ग्रंजर दोनों चाहते हैं। यह डेवलपमेंट प्रॉमिस करता है प्राइवेसी, प्रेस्टीज और सीमलेस लग्जरी। लोधामालाबार एक अल्ट्रा लग्जरियस रेजिडेंशियल प्रोजेक्ट है जिसके अंदर आपको देखने को मिलेगा 31 स्टोरी का हाई राइज़ टावर जो आपको ऑफर करेगा हर फ्लोर पर सिर्फ एक अपार्टमेंट। यह प्रोजेक्ट इंश्योर करता है अनमैच्ड प्राइवेसी पैनारोमिक व्यू और हर रेजिडेंस के लिए एक ग्रैंड सेंस ऑफ स्पेस। पोजीशन ऑफ़ दिस प्रोजेक्ट इज़ एक्सपेक्टेड बाय दिसंबर 2026। आल्सो इन दिस प्रोजेक्ट यू गेट मॉडर्न अमिनिटी सच एस जिम, वॉकिंग साइकिलिंग ट्रैक्स, आउटडोर लैब, स्विमिंग पूल, स्टेटिंग रिंग एंड इनडोर गेम्स एरिया। आल्सो यू गेट ग्रेट कनेक्टिविटी एस वेल सच एस श्री बाबुलनाथ मंदिर इज़ जस्ट 3 मिनट्स अवे। गिरगांव चौपाटी इज़ जस्ट 5 मिनट्स अवे। हैंगिंग गार्डन [...] 🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills Mumbai is an exceptional residential elevation offering a unique blend of peaceful living and urban convenience\n\n🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills Address Lodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006\n\n|| Amenities ||\n\n🏏Cricket Box \n\n🧗 Wall Climbing\n\n🏊‍♂️ Swimming Pool\n\n🏋️‍♀️ Gymnasium\n\n🏡 Clubhouse\n\n🌳 Landscaped Gardens\n\n🧘‍♂️ Yoga and Meditation Area\n\n🏃‍♂️ Jogging Track\n\n🎉 Multipurpose Hall\n\n🎮 Indoor Games Room\n\n🧑‍ Kids' Play Area\n\n🦳 Senior Citizen Zone\n\n|| Connectivity ||\n\n🛕 Shree Babulnath Mandir - 3 min\n\n🏖️ Girgaon Chowpatty - 5 min\n\n🏡 Hanging Garden - 9 min\n\n🚉 Charni Road Railway Station - 7 min\n\n🛣️ Coastal Road - 8 min","score":0.77405477,"raw_content":null,"id":"268204-05"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Malaba