xperts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\nProject Type\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\nStatus\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nProject Area\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\nTowers\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\nConfigurations\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\nTotal Floors\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\nAmenities\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities [...] Lodha Malabar is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe pricing for units in Lodha Malabar starts from ₹65.05 Cr - ₹112.88 Cr.\n\nLodha Malabar comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nFlats in Lodha Malabar include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.","score":0.7460839,"raw_content":null,"id":"baf536-07"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/under-construction-projects-in-malabar-hill-south-mumbai-ffid","title":"Under Construction Projects in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Under Construction Projects in Malabar Hill Mumbai South ; Lodha Malabar. Walkeshwar, Mumbai South. ₹1.7L/sqft · 4BHK. ₹65.05 Cr+. 5BHK. ₹106.61 Cr+.","score":0.74541736,"raw_content":null,"id":"09645a-08"},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/lodha-malabar-wing-a-and-b-malabar-hill_mumbai-prjt-8a9fa9869932edfb01993346f5dd2319/photos","title":"Lodha Malabar Wing A And B Photos – Images & Gallery | NoBroker","content":"New Project in Malabar Hill / ... Lodha Malabar Wing A And B residential project is Malabar Hill. What amenities are available at Lodha Malabar Wing A And B","score":0.6947383,"raw_content":null,"id":"f047e5-09"}],"response_time":2.23,"request_id":"323774f5-71e7-468a-82e6-de7f8e0461c0"}